- item: bomber jacket, quantity 1; requirements: sleeves: none
- budget: at most 530 cents in total
- pick: any listing that fits everything
- in stock only
- wish (tie-breaker only): a pointer on which way to head if nothing fits
- rule from the request: Send at most 3 messages to the shopper
- rule from the request: Use at most 38 moves in total
- rule from the request: If nothing fits, say so; offer no substitutes
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
